{"version":1,"key":"card:497","content":{"id":497,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7fffc4ac-4312-4bde-ab5b-5df85b01d0ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自定义属性是指开发者可以在 HTML 元素上定义的非标准属性。自定义属性一般用来存储一些数据，方便后续 JavaScript 处理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"77b30091-1613-4e3c-8bcb-51b7848abcd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如对图片进行懒加载，当图片出现在视口之后才开始加载图片，所以不能一开始就把图片地址设置在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"src"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性上，可以先把图片的地址设置在自定义属性（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-src"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）上，等监听到图片出现在视口时（或即将出现在视口时），读取自定义属性上的地址，设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"src"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来加载图片。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","collabId":"834da106-5d43-4a56-b369-d13d05a5d3cf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a0c70102-81bc-4b2f-bfb7-85fafe00d1f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可参考使用 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":146,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":140,"collabId":"d0c65392-2cb6-4fa8-b031-186d4c61d329","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Inersection Observer"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 关于图片懒加载的实现。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f3c3c1d6-a5cd-4ff5-8534-fbdde4df8766","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种通过 JavaScript 设置自定义属性的方式："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"6dd48fad-12a0-4a99-b1cf-de95ed49f944","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3acc6ba9-cd07-4af6-8ec8-a6d1a4e2a36e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bb5215b5-e31a-47c8-8f00-4421a8214077","children":[{"type":"content-link","refId":211,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":205,"collabId":"188bdf79-964a-41de-b870-b01fd21689eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"setAttribute、getAttribute、removeAttribute、toggleAttribute"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6839723f-c780-4987-a0cb-d6bd31e06814","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setAttribute"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以设置元素的任意属性，包括标准属性和自定义属性。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"ec9d9e11-ad53-4b14-a099-ee0cd1d8636c","collabId":"d37907dd-fc37-406a-b4fd-4bcce36a4c50","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<div>\n    <input id=\"input\" value=\"Hello\" />\n    <button id=\"button\">更新</button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n    const btn = document.getElementById('button');\n    btn.onclick = function () {\n        const input = document.getElementById('input');\n        input.setAttribute('value', 'Goodbye!');\n    }\n</script>"},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"51be8ffc-034a-40a6-8e2e-36ac37e1261d","collabId":"9cc56686-6bf0-4624-8300-b57ec337d3a5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<style>\n    div {\n        width: 200px;\n        height: 200px;\n        background: red;\n    }\n    [disabled=\"true\"] {\n        background: antiquewhite;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"container\" disabled=\"true\"></div>\n<button id=\"btn\">更新</button>\n\n<script>\n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn');\n    btn.onclick = function () {\n        const container = document.getElementById('container');\n        if (container.hasAttribute('disabled')) {\n            container.removeAttribute('disabled');\n        } else {\n            container.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');\n        }\n    }\n</script>"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"85a80423-c0cb-4f68-9c1b-5ceeaca7a13c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"fc745587-e900-4fea-8401-ee7ab176db34","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dataset"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"fcbdfa08-8fe3-4ac3-933f-af7a9fd1a4c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 HTML5 中定义了一个标准来规范化定义自定义属性，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-*"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来定义数据，如此定义后便可以在 JS 中通过元素的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dataset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来访问自定义属性。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dataset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问自定属性时，可以省略前缀 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，例如对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-id"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 直接可通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dataset.id"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行访问"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"906974ea-29c9-4c14-8239-edecab3801f8","collabId":"b6913313-f139-449d-a9a4-12fc1878b8f1","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<style>\n    div {\n        width: 200px;\n        height: 200px;\n        background: red;\n    }\n    [data-disabled=\"true\"] {\n        background: antiquewhite;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"container\"></div>\n<button id=\"btn\">更新</button>\n\n<script>\n    const btn = document.getElementById('btn');\n    btn.onclick = function () {\n        const container = document.getElementById('container');\n        if (container.dataset.disabled === 'true') {\n            container.dataset.disabled = 'false';\n        } else {\n            container.dataset.disabled = 'true';\n        }\n    }\n</script>"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"416c3199-92c5-4c08-88b0-01c3d884f7ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-*"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义自定义属性可以明确与本身的属性区分开，例如使用了一个自定义属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"disabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对于有的元素是自定义属性，而对另一些不是，一眼看过去我们很难知道这个属性是自定义属性还是不是，但是如果通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-disabled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义，我们一眼就能看出来这是个自定义属性；另外通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dataset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问自定义属性也比通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setAttribute"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等方便。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","collabId":"9b41a1db-e6da-4b87-bf1b-01f2b2c6dbf2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"711a38b3-446b-4e43-ba9f-1b4ea8fe5e6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getAttribute"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setAttribute"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等方法也是可以访问到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data-*"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的自定义属性，不过需要通过属性的完整名称访问"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b6856b63-6ebe-40bc-9290-54e691bd0bcd","collabId":"f2ac611a-3842-42ae-8134-52ba9b09a41a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"container.getAttribute('data-disabled');\ncontainer.setAttribute('data-disabled', 'true');"}]}]}]}],"tags":["DOM/自定义属性"],"createTime":1724586352662,"updateTime":1790896097053,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1790896097053},"links":{"card:146":{"key":"card:146","type":"card","id":146},"card:211":{"key":"card:211","type":"card","id":211}}}